This dataset contains epifluorescence and confocal images from the BLA collaterals project. AAVrg.pgk.cre was infused in AIC and AAV1-FLEX-tdTomato in BLA. Survival time: 3 weeks. Epifluorescence images were taken at 4X. 80 um slices. The authors are grateful to Drew B. Headley for granting access to the Keyence microscope (Itasca, IL; model BZ-X810).
